description: React TypeScript Zustand conventions for Easy Downloader
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Frontend

- TypeScript strict mode; prefer clear names and small functions.
- Reusable components; avoid duplicated logic.
- No business logic in React components — use Zustand stores and `src/lib`.
- Validate URLs and form input on the client before invoke; still re-validate in Rust.
- Use typed IPC wrappers from `src/lib/tauri.ts` — do not call raw `invoke` with magic strings in features.
- Handle errors explicitly; surface user-facing messages via store/toast state.
